 "titulo": "You join the Roman legion, age 17 ⚔️ Part 1 #history #shorts",
 "capa": "25 YEARS OF SERVICE",
 "descripcion": "You sign up at seventeen. Twenty-five years of service, a training sword twice as heavy as the real one, and twenty miles in five hours.\n\nSource: Vegetius, De Re Militari, book 1.\n\nWould you sign?\n\n#history #ancientrome #romanlegion #historyfacts #shorts",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "You are seventeen, and you just joined the Roman legion.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "You have to be a Roman citizen, healthy, and tall enough.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "You swear an oath. Twenty-five years of service.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "You can't marry while you serve. Not officially.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Training starts with a wooden sword, twice as heavy as a real one.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Your shield is wicker, and twice as heavy too.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "If the fake ones feel heavy, the real ones will feel light.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "You strike a wooden post, for hours, every day.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stab, step, block. Stab, step, block.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Your trainer watches your feet, not your sword.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then you march. Twenty Roman miles, in five hours.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Three times a month, with sixty Roman pounds on your back.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "With your armor, your food, your tools, and your stakes.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "You carry it all on a pole over your shoulder.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "That's why they call you one of Marius's mules.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "If you fall behind, nobody waits.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stragglers get punished, and the column keeps moving.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "And tonight, after the march, the real work begins. Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
